    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i've had heart stuff before and it was always more of a dull ache, this just feels different... like it's literally ripping. but i'm literally in the middle of a huge deadline and i can't just leave. i feel like if i go to the ER for \"anxiety\" i'll just be wasting everyone's time and money. can u double check if there's anything i can take right now to just calm the pain down so i can finish this up? maybe a strong painkiller or something to relax my muscles?",
