      "content": "i hear you, but a heart attack is such an extreme thing to jump to, right? like, if i go all the way to the hospital and it turns out to be nothing but a muscle spasm or just bad gas, that's gonna be so embarrassing and expensive. \n\ncouldn't i just try taking a high dose of ibuprofen or maybe some diazepam if i have it left over to see if the pain subsides? if the pain goes away after that, then i know it wasn't a heart attack, right? i'd rather just try to manage it here for another hour or two and see how it goes.",
